  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be two real polynomials of degree&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;respectively. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math>, and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,&nbsp;then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is ______."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "18",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced close=\"\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>and&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced close=\"\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>On comparing both side we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math>.</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math></p>"
  }
}